          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uruzitiro rumaze gusanurwa nkamara no gutera inzugi, haciye hashirwaho abarinzi b’amarembo n’abaririmvyi n’Abalewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshiraho Hanani, uwo tuvukana ngo atware i Yerusalemu, ari kumwe na Hananiya umukuru w’ingabo zo mu gisagara c’i Yerusalemu, kuko yari umuntu w’intungane kandi yubaha Imana kurusha abandi benshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndababwira nti: “Amarembo y’i Yerusalemu ntaze yugururwe kugeza ku musase. Abarinzi b’amarembo bakiri ku gikorwa cabo, muze mwugare inzugi mushireko n’ibihindizo bigumya inzugi zugaye. Kandi muze mushinge ababa i Yerusalemu ngo babe abarinzi, bamwe ku birindiro vyabo abandi imbere y’amazu yabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri ico gihe igisagara cari caragutse ari kinini, ariko hari abantu bake bakibamwo, kandi n’amazu ntiyari bwasanurwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Imana yanje ishira ku mutima wanje kwegeraniriza hamwe abanyacubahiro, abakuru n’abantu bose kugira ngo biyandikishe uko imiryango yabo iri. Maze ntora igitabu canditswemwo abari baragarutse ubwa mbere. Ibi ni vyo nasanze vyanditswemwo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "73",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:73"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "73",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ukwezi kw’indwi kwashitse Abisirayeli bamaze kuja mu bisagara vyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.73",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.73"
            ]
          }
